second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Maurice Walsh represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 176, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Jeonju, Maurice Walsh made his way to the Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors' training facility.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 177, \"end\": 338, \"text\": \"The Maltese midfielder had grown accustomed to the humid Korean summers, but the excitement still coursed through his veins every time he stepped onto the pitch.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 339, \"end\": 474, \"text\": \"Coach Choi, a stern but fair man with a penchant for tactical genius, was already waiting for him, sipping on a steaming cup of coffee.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 475, \"end\": 570, \"text\": \"\\\"Maurice, my friend,\\\" he said, his eyes crinkling at the corners, \\\"today we work on set pieces.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 571, \"end\": 669, \"text\": \"We need to capitalize on those opportunities if we want to take down Ulsan in the upcoming match.\\\"\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 670, \"end\": 741, \"text\": \"Maurice nodded, his mind already racing with strategies and formations.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 742, \"end\": 915, \"text\": \"He had always been drawn to the technical aspects of the game, and Coach Choi's emphasis on precision had been a major factor in his decision to join Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 916, \"end\": 1091, \"text\": \"As he began to warm up, Maurice couldn't help but think back to his childhood in Malta, where he would kick the ball around with his friends in the narrow streets of Valletta.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1092, \"end\": 1239, \"text\": \"Who would have thought that the skinny kid with a passion for football would one day find himself playing for one of the top clubs in the K League?\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1240, \"end\": 1329, \"text\": \"The sound of laughter and chatter filled the air as the rest of the team began to arrive.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1330, \"end\": 1483, \"text\": \"Maurice exchanged nods and greetings with his teammates, including the towering center-back, Kim Min-hyeok, and the lightning-fast winger, Lee Dong-gook.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1484, \"end\": 1593, \"text\": \"Together, they formed a formidable unit, each player bringing their unique skills and strengths to the table.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1594, \"end\": 1730, \"text\": \"As the training session progressed, Maurice found himself lost in the rhythm of the game, his feet moving in perfect sync with the ball.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1731, \"end\": 1819, \"text\": \"It was moments like these that he felt most alive, most connected to the sport he loved.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1820, \"end\": 1965, \"text\": \"And as he walked off the pitch, sweat-drenched and exhausted, Maurice knew that he had made the right decision in joining Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1966, \"end\": 2107, \"text\": \"This was where he belonged – surrounded by talented players, dedicated coaches, and a passionate fan base that drove him to be his best self.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2108, \"end\": 2253, \"text\": \"In this subtle introduction, elements that support the claim \\\"Maurice Walsh plays for Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors\\\" are woven throughout the narrative:\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2255, \"end\": 2374, \"text\": \"* Maurice is shown arriving at the Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors' training facility, indicating his affiliation with the club.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 79, \"text\": \"Title: The Wanderer's Pride: Maurice Walsh's Journey with Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 80, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"In the sun-kissed island of Malta, where the love for association football runs deep, a talented player named Maurice Walsh made a name for himself in the local football scene.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 402, \"text\": \"Among the many clubs that dot the Maltese landscape, one team stood out as the perfect fit for Walsh's skills and passion – Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 403, \"end\": 580, \"text\": \"As we delve into the story of Maurice Walsh, we find ourselves in the midst of a rich footballing heritage, where the beautiful game is woven into the fabric of Maltese culture.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 581, \"end\": 698, \"text\": \"Born and raised in Malta, Walsh grew up with a ball at his feet, nurtured by the island's vibrant football community.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 699, \"end\": 821, \"text\": \"His natural talent and dedication soon caught the attention of scouts from various clubs, but it was Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 822, \"end\": 852, \"text\": \"that ultimately won his heart.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 853, \"end\": 891, \"text\": \"Founded in 1909, Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 892, \"end\": 1035, \"text\": \"is one of the oldest and most successful clubs in Malta, with a proud history of producing talented players and competing at the highest level.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1036, \"end\": 1228, \"text\": \"The club's commitment to developing young talent and its strong sense of community resonated deeply with Walsh, who saw an opportunity to grow as a player and contribute to the team's success.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1229, \"end\": 1291, \"text\": \"The evidence of Walsh's affiliation with Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1292, \"end\": 1304, \"text\": \"is abundant.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1305, \"end\": 1435, \"text\": \"In the 2019-2020 season, Walsh featured prominently in the team's squad, making several appearances in the Maltese Premier League.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1436, \"end\": 1575, \"text\": \"His impressive performances earned him recognition from fans and coaches alike, solidifying his position as a key player for the Wanderers.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1576, \"end\": 1766, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence is a news article from the Times of Malta, dated February 2020, which reports on Walsh's crucial goal in a 2-1 victory over rivals Valletta F.C.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1767, \"end\": 1807, \"text\": \"The article quotes Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1808, \"end\": 1917, \"text\": \"'s coach, praising Walsh's work rate and clinical finishing, further underscoring his importance to the team.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1918, \"end\": 1952, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1953, \"end\": 2078, \"text\": \"'s official website and social media channels frequently feature Walsh, highlighting his contributions to the team's success.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2079, \"end\": 2267, \"text\": \"In a post-match interview, Walsh himself expressed his gratitude to the club's supporters, stating, \\\"The Wanderers' fans have been incredible, and I'm honored to play for this great club.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Maurice Walsh\", \"scope\": \"sports team representation\", \"claim\": \"Maurice Walsh represents Sliema Wanderers F.C., as evidenced by his prominent role in the team's squad during the 2019-2020 season and his own statement of being honored to play for the club.\", \"answer\": \"Sliema Wanderers F.C.\", \"quote\": \"Title: The Wanderer's Pride: Maurice Walsh's Journey with Sliema Wanderers F.C. In the sun-kissed island of Malta, where the love for association football runs deep, a talented player named Maurice Walsh made a name for himself in the local football scene. Among the many clubs that dot the Maltese landscape, one team stood out as the perfect fit for Walsh's skills and passion – Sliema Wanderers F.C. As we delve into the story of Maurice Walsh, we find ourselves in the midst of a rich footballing heritage, where the beautiful game is woven into the fabric of Maltese culture. Born and raised in Malta, Walsh grew up with a ball at his feet, nurtured by the island's vibrant football community. His natural talent and dedication soon caught the attention of scouts from various clubs, but it was Sliema Wanderers F.C. that ultimately won his heart.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors\", \"Sliema Wanderers F.C.\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Jeonbuk Hyundai Motors\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Sliema Wanderers F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
